 null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR", "keywords": ["ForkliftSimulator", "ForkliftExtremeSimulator", "ForklifDriver", "ForkliftDrivingSimulator"], "long_description": "Step into the ultimate VR forklift experience with Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR!\nWhether you\u2019re a professional looking to sharpen your skills or a VR enthusiast craving realistic machinery gameplay, this simulator delivers immersive, hands-on forklift operation like never before.\nRealistic Controls & Physics: Feel the weight and precision of operating a real forklift. Use authentic controls to lift, stack, and transport pallets through a fully detailed warehouse environment.\nChallenging Missions: Complete a variety of tasks, from delicate pallet stacking to fast-paced loading challenges. Each mission tests your accuracy, timing, and planning skills.\nMultiple Forklift Types: Choose from different forklift models, including counterbalance, reach trucks, and pallet jacks, each with unique handling characteristics.\nImmersive VR Environment: Designed exclusively for VR headsets like Meta Quest, enjoy 360-degree interaction with realistic sound effects and detailed warehouse layouts.\nSkill Progression: Improve your forklift operation skills as you unlock new levels, harder challenges, and performance achievements.\nSafety & Training: Perfect for aspiring forklift operators or warehouse professionals seeking a risk-free training environment. Learn proper forklift techniques in a virtual space.\nWhether you want professional training or just some fun lifting and stacking, Pro Forklift Simulator Extreme VR delivers a realistic and engaging experience that puts you in the driver\u2019s s", "short_description": "Experience realistic forklift operations in immersive VR. Master challenging warehouse tasks and become a pro operator!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/horizonhub-privacypolic